'''Jean Barrett''' (born May 24, 1951) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was an [[offensive lineman]] for the [[San Francisco 49ers]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL).<ref>{{cite news | url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/tulsa-world/163720477/ | title=Unbending Walsh Made TU's Barrett an Ex-49er | work=[[Tulsa World]] | date=January 10, 1982 | accessdate=23 January 2025}}</ref> He graduated [[W. T. White High School]] in [[Dallas, Texas]], and played [[college football]] for the [[Tulsa Golden Hurricane football|Tulsa Golden Hurricane]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Jean Barrett |url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/B/BarrJe20.htm |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220819220145/https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/B/BarrJe20.htm |archive-date=2022-08-19 |access-date=2023-04-25 |website=Pro-Football-Reference.com |language=en}}</ref>
